{"id": "EUVD-2026-82165", "enisaUuid": "9f036b8b-076a-3cbe-ba15-e7ced68eb3a7", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nUDF symlink pathComponent header OOB read\n\nudf_symlink_filler() can enter udf_pc_to_char() with a partial pathComponent header.\n\nValidate that enough input remains for a complete pathComponent header\nbefore accessing it. Reject malformed symlink data that would otherwise\nmake udf_pc_to_char() perform an out-of-bounds read.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:10:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:04:50", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d9f49c8b55debf1512f912077b6c759cc8b6d2e0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48b2a74317e15f93983c74a5a07245bc94a00d39", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f44f5f795f1a56249821a05183347ea025855e31", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/57371e743398e0d485f0f7beede1ade41f812324", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee264227b656218bc1b257d8e4f83467f5f17723", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8da8fd3df9fc14cf79ca3a3978d27ba067985111", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b21cb958292ee1e02eb305ff9de09f2f7edd551a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d23eb7380d1594cda31a5dc8487dd2a5c8def8c7"], "aliases": ["GHSA-656h-699m-59g6", "CVE-2026-93055"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0ea2578e-fd05-30c2-bff4-7d4eb8f54513", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <57371e743398e0d485f0f7beede1ade41f812324"}, {"id": "0f404597-5345-3af9-9980-e53487e923cf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <b21cb958292ee1e02eb305ff9de09f2f7edd551a"}, {"id": "0f438162-b612-347c-9520-30c6fc0e2a6c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <8da8fd3df9fc14cf79ca3a3978d27ba067985111"}, {"id": "1a0cd841-11a6-3909-abfe-ee2a6